 "subtitles": [
  {
   "start": 0.5,
   "end": 2.517,
   "text": "I go to a lot of live shows,"
  },
  {
   "start": 2.557,
   "end": 5.527,
   "text": "so I built Onda: a diary for those nights."
  },
  {
   "start": 5.567,
   "end": 7.05,
   "text": "I designed it, built it,"
  },
  {
   "start": 7.09,
   "end": 8.689,
   "text": "and run it in production."
  },
  {
   "start": 8.729,
   "end": 10.365,
   "text": "Here is the whole system,"
  },
  {
   "start": 10.405,
   "end": 12.224,
   "text": "one tap at a time."
  },
  {
   "start": 13.07,
   "end": 16.459,
   "text": "Friday. Maya opens Onda to find a show."
  },
  {
   "start": 16.499,
   "end": 18.135,
   "text": "Where do the events come from?"
  },
  {
   "start": 18.175,
   "end": 20.497,
   "text": "From a website I do not control."
  },
  {
   "start": 20.537,
   "end": 23.011,
   "text": "So Onda trusts nothing it sends."
  },
  {
   "start": 23.051,
   "end": 24.688,
   "text": "Each night it fetches the listings"
  },
  {
   "start": 24.728,
   "end": 26.888,
   "text": "inside hard limits."
  },
  {
   "start": 26.928,
   "end": 28.792,
   "text": "It stores every raw response"
  },
  {
   "start": 28.832,
   "end": 30.773,
   "text": "before any code reads it."
  },
  {
   "start": 30.813,
   "end": 33.364,
   "text": "Then each listing gets its own transaction."
  },
  {
   "start": 33.404,
   "end": 35.345,
   "text": "A valid one becomes an event."
  },
  {
   "start": 35.385,
   "end": 38.164,
   "text": "A broken one leaves only a rejection record."
  },
  {
   "start": 38.204,
   "end": 40.652,
   "text": "The website's identifiers stop at a map,"
  },
  {
   "start": 40.692,
   "end": 42.164,
   "text": "so I can replay any night"
  },
  {
   "start": 42.204,
   "end": 44.747,
   "text": "and nothing is created twice."
  },
  {
   "start": 44.947,
   "end": 46.761,
   "text": "Maya taps an event."
  },
  {
   "start": 46.801,
   "end": 49.25,
   "text": "Her request never waits for that website."
  },
  {
   "start": 49.29,
   "end": 51.307,
   "text": "It reads my own database."
  },
  {
   "start": 51.347,
   "end": 53.516,
   "text": "One server, three containers."
  },
  {
   "start": 53.556,
   "end": 56.594,
   "text": "Only the proxy faces the internet."
  },
  {
   "start": 56.794,
   "end": 58.659,
   "text": "Saturday, she goes."
  },
  {
   "start": 58.699,
   "end": 60.64,
   "text": "Sunday, she rates the night:"
  },
  {
   "start": 60.68,
   "end": 62.316,
   "text": "four and a half stars."
  },
  {
   "start": 62.356,
   "end": 65.28,
   "text": "A diary entry has three states."
  },
  {
   "start": 65.618,
   "end": 67.788,
   "text": "Every write passes four guards."
  },
  {
   "start": 67.828,
   "end": 69.388,
   "text": "The last one is the schema,"
  },
  {
   "start": 69.428,
   "end": 71.521,
   "text": "so no code path can skip it."
  },
  {
   "start": 71.561,
   "end": 73.197,
   "text": "Two taps at the same instant"
  },
  {
   "start": 73.237,
   "end": 75.361,
   "text": "still make one row."
  },
  {
   "start": 75.561,
   "end": 77.959,
   "text": "Now her friend Leo opens Home."
  },
  {
   "start": 77.999,
   "end": 80.499,
   "text": "There is no feed table to keep in sync."
  },
  {
   "start": 80.539,
   "end": 82.073,
   "text": "Home is one query."
  },
  {
   "start": 82.113,
   "end": 84.511,
   "text": "Five branches, each filtered for privacy,"
  },
  {
   "start": 84.551,
   "end": 85.959,
   "text": "then one sort."
  },
  {
   "start": 85.999,
   "end": 88.321,
   "text": "His cursor is the key of the last row,"
  },
  {
   "start": 88.361,
   "end": 90.759,
   "text": "so new activity never shifts his page."
  },
  {
   "start": 90.799,
   "end": 92.283,
   "text": "At 100,000 rows,"
  },
  {
   "start": 92.323,
   "end": 95.361,
   "text": "a page takes 88 milliseconds."
  },
  {
   "start": 95.837,
   "end": 97.295,
   "text": "I know where this stops scaling,"
  },
  {
   "start": 97.335,
   "end": 100.018,
   "text": "and the docs say what I would try next."
  },
  {
   "start": 101.218,
   "end": 103.083,
   "text": "Maya plans her next show."
  },
  {
   "start": 103.123,
   "end": 105.216,
   "text": "Then the website drops that listing."
  },
  {
   "start": 105.256,
   "end": 106.435,
   "text": "Is the show cancelled,"
  },
  {
   "start": 106.475,
   "end": 108.437,
   "text": "or did the fetch fail?"
  },
  {
   "start": 108.477,
   "end": 109.554,
   "text": "A miss only counts"
  },
  {
   "start": 109.594,
   "end": 111.535,
   "text": "when the whole snapshot arrived."
  },
  {
   "start": 111.575,
   "end": 113.364,
   "text": "Three misses hide the event."
  },
  {
   "start": 113.404,
   "end": 115.192,
   "text": "One sighting brings it back."
  },
  {
   "start": 115.232,
   "end": 116.259,
   "text": "Nothing is deleted,"
  },
  {
   "start": 116.299,
   "end": 119.109,
   "text": "and a past night never changes."
  },
  {
   "start": 119.309,
   "end": 120.945,
   "text": "And if I ship a bad change,"
  },
  {
   "start": 120.985,
   "end": 122.469,
   "text": "or the server dies?"
  },
  {
   "start": 122.509,
   "end": 125.356,
   "text": "Every change passes five checks."
  },
  {
   "start": 125.594,
   "end": 127.535,
   "text": "Only the tested commit deploys,"
  },
  {
   "start": 127.575,
   "end": 128.5,
   "text": "after a backup,"
  },
  {
   "start": 128.54,
   "end": 130.126,
   "text": "with a health check behind it."
  },
  {
   "start": 130.166,
   "end": 130.786,
   "text": "Every day,"
  },
  {
   "start": 130.826,
   "end": 133.097,
   "text": "an encrypted backup leaves the server."
  },
  {
   "start": 133.137,
   "end": 135.23,
   "text": "Every month, a job restores one,"
  },
  {
   "start": 135.27,
   "end": 137.897,
   "text": "because an untested backup is only a hope."
  },
  {
   "start": 137.937,
   "end": 139.726,
   "text": "It is still one server."
  },
  {
   "start": 139.766,
   "end": 142.164,
   "text": "A bad day can cost a day of data."
  },
  {
   "start": 142.204,
   "end": 144.424,
   "text": "At this size, that is the right price,"
  },
  {
   "start": 144.464,
   "end": 147.223,
   "text": "and the docs say when it stops being right."
  },
  {
   "start": 148.223,
   "end": 150.24,
   "text": "Trust nothing from outside."
  },
  {
   "start": 150.28,
   "end": 152.221,
   "text": "Keep every write atomic."
  },
  {
   "start": 152.261,
   "end": 154.278,
   "text": "Derive instead of copying."
  },
  {
   "start": 154.318,
   "end": 155.954,
   "text": "Prove what you run."
  },
  {
   "start": 155.994,
   "end": 158.545,
   "text": "Sixteen decisions, each with its cost,"
  },
  {
   "start": 158.585,
   "end": 160.145,
   "text": "are in the repository."
  },
  {
   "start": 160.185,
   "end": 162.004,
   "text": "Thank you for your time."
  }
 ]
}
